      en: ["The principal church of the Maronite Archdiocese of Beirut.", "Its design was inspired by the Basilica of Santa Maria Maggiore in Rome.", "Stands side-by-side with the Mohammad Al-Amin Mosque.", "Constructed in a Neoclassical architectural style between 1884 and 1894.", "Heavily damaged during the civil war and subsequently restored.", "A 72-meter campanile (bell tower) was added and completed in 2016."]
